# 🚀 AfriCredit - Alternative Data Credit Scoring Engine

Mfumo wa Fintech unaokusanya Data Mbadala (Alternative Data) kutoka kwa wajasiriamali wadogo 
ili kutengeneza Credit Score ya kidijitali kwa ajili ya Stock Financing.

---

## 📌 Features za Mfano (Prototype Features)
- 📊 **Credit Scoring Algorithm:** Inachakata data za mauzo na ununuzi na kutoa alama (0 - 100).
- 📲 **USSD & Mobile Interface Simulation:** Inasimulia jinsi mfanyabiashara anavyoingiza mauzo.
- 🔌 **Supplier API Mock:** Mfano wa unganisho la data kutoka kwa MSAMBAZAJI (Wholesaler).
- 🏦 **Bank Credit Decision Engine:** Mfano wa API inayorudisha majibu kwa benki (APPROVED / REJECTED).

---

## 🛠️ Jinsi Scoring Algorithm Inavyofanya Kazi (Formula Overview)
Alama ya Mkopo (Credit Score) inahesabiwa kwa kutumia vigezo vifuatavyo:
1. **Consistency (35%):** Mzunguko wa ununuzi wa bidhaa kila mwezi.
2. **Supplier Loyalty (30%):** Uaminifu wa ulipaji wa bidhaa za zamani.
3. **Transaction Volume (25%):** Mzunguko wa fedha za kila siku.
4. **Business Age (10%):** Muda ambao biashara imekuwa kwenye mfumo.

---

## 🚀 Jinsi ya Kujaribu Mfumo (How to Run Locally)

### Prerequisites
- Python 3.x au Node.js (Kulingana na lugha uliyotumia)

### Installation
1. Clone repository hii:
   git clone https://github.com/username/africredit-scoring-engine.git

2. Ingia kwenye folder:
   cd africredit-scoring-engine

3. Endesha mfumo:
   python main.py
